<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 46, Texas won by Southwest Sec.</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 46, Texas won by Southwest Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Inc. said it won $1.160 million of Harris Cty MUD 46, Texas, waterworks and sewer system bonds, Series 1997 with a net interest cost of 5.45 percent.</p>
</text>
